    "title": "Lake drawdown to begin Sept. 22 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Sandpoint Reader\nwebsite\nClark Fork\nLake drawdown to begin Sept. 22\nBy Ben Olson,\n1 hours agoLake Pend Oreille will remain at summer pool elevation — 2,062-2,062.5 feet — through Sunday, Sept. 21, with the gradual fall drawdown to begin Monday, Sept. 22. The U.S. Army Corps of Engineers set a target of 2,060-2061 feet by Sept. 30 and 2,051-2,051.5 feet no later than Nov. 15.",
